---
import FullImage from "../../components/FullImage.astro";
import heroImg from "../../assets/archive/hero.webp";
---

<FullImage
  image={heroImg}
  title="State of the<br />Open Home<br />2026"
  headingLevel="h1"
  alt="A packed auditorium raising their hands towards the stage at State of the Open Home 2026"
  hasScrollEntry={false}
  priority
  compactTitle
  overlayColor="#001744"
  objectPosition="center"
>
  <p class="p--large">
    There was a big change to State of the Open Home this year, as we welcomed
    a live audience for the first time since 2019! And the buzz it created
    showed why meeting in person is so important.
  </p>
  <p class="p--large">
    This year’s theme was all about building in the open, with a program that
    didn’t just show you how we work, but invited you to help build what’s
    next…
  </p>
</FullImage>

<style>
  /* Figma: 24px / 1.3, with a blank line between paragraphs. */
  p {
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  p:not(:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 1.3em;
  }
</style>
